sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Cam as Driver webcam
  participant DMS as Driver monitoring
  participant UI as Cabin display
  participant Au as Car audio
  actor D as Driver
  Cam->>DMS: frames — they never leave this box
  DMS->>DMS: face landmarks → eyes, mouth, head angle
  DMS->>UI: numbers only: eyes-closed share, yawns, head angle, outline 0..1
  UI->>UI: learn this driver's normal, then compare
  UI->>D: "Signs of drowsiness. Take a break soon."
  UI->>Au: warning, rate-limited
  Au->>D: "Stay alert."
